{"title":"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/b/97b1585ca65be41e61989680b4171c3197eb8fa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[x-(y-z)] - [(x-y) - z] =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"236\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/325d6eb515722a95aa81f74e52c49e344b131db6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2y \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2z \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ -2y \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ -2z \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"430\" height=\"17\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/1036230e26e3a6046670d4aa00945987f469fc62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-y+z)-(x-y-z) = x-y+z-x+y+z = 2z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"436\" height=\"20\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME\" title=\"1986 AHSME\">1986 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1986 AHSM